{%- comment -%}
  Reusable schema settings for neumorphic customization.

  Copy the settings array below into any section's {% raw %}{% schema %}{% endraw %} block.
  Then render the snippet at the top of the section:

    {% render 'neu-settings', section: section %}
{%- endcomment -%}

